==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s (3,000%) spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 2~20 seconds<sup>60f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**4 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**3 [[Dober P.D]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is very useful, since he can block [[Dober P.D]]'s [[Wave Attack]]s. You should also bring 1 or 2 [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]]/[[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie cats]] for the Zang Roos. Fill the rest with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|A. Bahamut]], ranged attackers and meatshields. [[Sarukani (Uber Rare Cat)|Sarukani]] or [[Mighty Drednot (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Drednot]] can be really good for killing the Zang Roos quickly. If the Zang Roos are killed, the stage isn't very hard anymore. The Dobers should be fairly easy to kill with Octopus Cat and Bahamut. Once all the Dobers are dead, just destroy the base and win.

You can use a strong rusher (such as Awakened Bahamut or [[Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Twinstars]]) alongside a [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Lone Cat and Kitten]] to cheese the stage if your timing is right. The Zang Roos will burrow past them, while the Lone Cat and Kitten stops Dober from destroying Bahamut. With enough meatshields, you should be able to slow the Zang Roos' inexorable approach long enough for your rusher to destroy the base. Your rusher needs enough attack power to destroy the base before the second Dober spawns, and while Bahamut can usually do this on his own, others may need a lot of extra help.

